        "AbstractText": "A 22-year-old woman suffering from Behcet's disease and severe angina was diagnosed with a left anterior descending coronary artery giant pseudoaneurysm. Preoperative investigations, surgical management, and its principles, as well as specific postoperative follow-up considerations are described."
